## Notes

Top level meta blocks are used to define notes. Here is a note with all
available attributes added to it and an explanation of what they mean:

> [ #2
    pin
    @myproject
    due:2000-01-24
    created:2000-01-24
  ]
    The note body.

|-------------------------------------------------
| # #1 #2 #3
| Note priority. Lower numbers are more urgent.
|   #1 = High, #2 = Normal (default), #3 = Low.
|-------------------------------------------------
| pin
| A marker used for sorting and filtering.
|-------------------------------------------------
| @myproject
| Note is tagged with a project. Use project tags
|  to filter notes in the main view.
|-------------------------------------------------
| due:2000-01-24
| Note has a due date. The date format follows
|  the ISO 8601 spec: year-month-day.
|-------------------------------------------------
| created:2000-01-24
| Date of creation in ISO format.
|-------------------------------------------------
| hide
| Hidden notes only appear with filters of the
|  form ``hide`` or ``hide & expr``.
|-------------------------------------------------
